            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Water-activated kraft on kraft box</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Packaging Tape FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">BOPP vs kraft vs water-activated?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">BOPP for everyday e-comm. Kraft for premium recyclable. Water-activated for tamper-evident permanent bond.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">When to use reinforced tape?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Boxes over 15kg, international shipping, pallet stacks. Fibreglass strands prevent tape split.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">How to choose tape thickness?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">45 micron under 5kg; 50-55 for 5-15kg; 60+ for heavy-duty and cold chain.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Why water-activated for e-commerce brands?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Tamper-evident, looks premium, fully recyclable, bonds chemically with kraft.</p>
          </details>
