            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Best tape for cold storage?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Cold-temp BOPP with -20°C-rated acrylic adhesive. Always sample-test cold conditions first.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
