        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Stocking up on BOPP for your warehouse, switching to kraft for sustainability, or testing water-activated for premium unboxing? We supply all four tape families at wholesale pricing, with custom print available from 36 rolls.</p>
