      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: Tape Choice Is a Shipping Strategy</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">The cheapest tape is rarely the cheapest decision once you factor in damage claims, brand impression, and the subtle ways customers feel a box arriving. Match the tape to the journey: light e-commerce gets workhorse BOPP, heavy export gets reinforced, premium D2C gets water-activated kraft. Get this layer right and the rest of your packaging strategy clicks into place.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">WhatsApp us for a sample roll of any tape grade — try before you commit to a bulk order.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
